  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Upgrade Apitomy Flow to 3.0.5 and fix receive-event output mapping by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/629\n* Support polled GitHub PR events (merged, assigned, review updates, inline review comments) by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/630\n* Update dependency mermaid to v12.3.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/632\n* Update dependency rimraf to v6.1.4 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/631\n* Make the timeout configurable for script and node action types by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/634\n* Subscription preview: toggle to show only matched events by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/pull/636\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-axiom/compare/v3.0.2...v3.0.3",
